==Trivia ==
*This mutant form does not have the same setbacks as [[Kevin 11]] did due to him having mastered his absorbing powers. Additionally, between his time spent in the [[Null Void (Classic)|Null Void]] and [[Ben 10,000 (Original)|Ben 10,000]] sending so many aliens there, Kevin 11,000 has more alien DNA than Ben.{{Refn|[[:File:Ken 10 Pop-up (20).png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="Ken 10" />
*Kevin 11,000 was designed by [[Thomas N. Perkins IV]].{{Refn|[[:File:Tom Designed S3 & S4 Characters.png]]|group = TNP}}{{Refn|[[:File:Kevin 11K Permutations.png]]|group = TNP|name = snipe}}
**Out of all of Kevin's mutations in the Classic Continuity, Kevin 11,000 is Thomas' favorite.{{Refn|[[:File:Tom Perkins' favorite kevin mutation.PNG]]|group = TNP}}
**At the time, Thomas designed him with the idea that he could cycle through any number of permutations, much like Ben 10,000 could, or mash up different DNA hybridizations.{{Refn|group = TNP|name = snipe}}

